# Quality Gates
# Scope: file/function/class size limits, coverage minimums, security (pickle, credentials).
# For linting tool config (E501, basedpyright), see quality-gates-hardening.mdc.
RULE: File 900 lines max; function 100; class 500; method 50. Coverage 35% min. No pickle; no credentials in repo.
WHY: Template enforces consistency; security violations are BLOCKING.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md
DO: Use joblib/JSON/Parquet not pickle; *credentials*.json in gitignore; run via quickmerge (see always-use-quickmerge.mdc)
NEVER: pickle.loads; commit credential JSON; exceed file/function limits without split
See also: quality-gates-hardening.mdc (E501, basedpyright tool config)
